                      class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                      data-alt="A professional studio portrait of a friendly male real estate professional in his 40s wearing a navy blue blazer and white shirt. The background is a soft, blurred modern architectural interior. The lighting is crisp and corporate, matching a clean high-end financial app aesthetic. High-fidelity reliability style."
